# Uploads are ignored by default: what a shop's staff upload belongs to that
# deployment, not to the repository.
*
!.gitignore

# The exception is the seeded brand imagery, which the demo catalog references
# by path. Without it a fresh clone runs but shows a shop full of broken
# images, so these are treated as fixtures rather than as uploads.
!products/
!products/*.png
!hero/
!hero/*.jpg
